{"version":1,"key":"article:8","content":{"id":8,"title":"笔记折腾之旅","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e277d87a-80fd-4fa4-a0fb-726de1326adf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录从上大学开始到现在做笔记的方式，先是手抄纸质笔记，然后是折腾各种电子笔记，在进阶自定义个人博客，到现在自己写了一个笔记软件。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"eccf816e-5c73-4ef5-b737-941b727546af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"手抄笔记"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e655f815-707d-4197-b31d-a23c583a0afb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自从上了大学之后，知识越发艰涩难懂，往往我看完一遍书之后，都不知道自己看了什么，所以当时就觉得我需要做笔记，我那时为每门科目都准备了一个笔记本，形式感很足，不过那时的我做笔记的方法一般就是抄一遍 PPT。抄 PPT 这一行为，说实话，屁用没有，并且十分的费时间，一个章节几十页 PPT，一门课就是几百页 PPT，手都抄麻了，当时真吃饱了撑的。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/4f4c45d7accd1af1c1a8377676651192021-10-02-21-37-53.jpg","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/4f4c45d7accd1af1c1a8377676651192021-10-02-21-37-53.jpg","width":539.5,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fd94e34f-764b-420f-8949-21ac9bec012c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4b90119-3caf-4929-b308-a13704d6263d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当时我也不是没有反省过，抄 PPT 有用么，有这功夫不如将 PPT 打印下来，回去慢慢看，跟你抄的也差不多。所以中间也停过一段时间，但是没有找到更好的破局之法，然后又去抄 PPT 了。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d3db1377-1613-44c1-a7c3-f0979ea8d6a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"电子笔记：OneNote"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7fee8710-1687-4a86-8557-ac325eebfdd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是我大一大二的事情，因为那个时候我接触电脑没有多久，还不会用它来记笔记，对电脑的理解可能就是上网工具。后来了解到了很多的笔记软件，我当时选择用 OneNote 来记笔记，当时觉得这软件太牛逼了，几乎满足了我当时的需求，但是后面随着需求的增加，OneNote 就不够看了，比如："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"d16b6c60-e87f-4b79-b6d2-261ca9d76c2c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"44812cef-b62b-492e-a89c-5815b41bc0ee","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7daa73b5-752c-439c-acac-99f836f3d2df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码支持不好，没有高亮"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"61226aae-734c-4c6f-a84d-284a65729454","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46801cf9-2c74-4f07-a8ce-68db84f96441","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数学公式支持很差"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"90b5ec80-b841-45b8-9d00-8ea18125c0d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"初识博客：CSDN与博客园"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f75d1037-f7c0-4589-af3a-825f9baff6f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后来接触到编程，我开始在网上自学 Python，当时那个讲师说希望学完一节内容之后能写一篇博客，总结学习内容，这个时候我开始在 CSDN 上面写文章，记录学习内容，因为 CSDN 的编辑器默认是 Markdown，当时是我第一次知道 Markdown 这个东西，我还特意学习了 Markdown 的语法，自从学会以后，我就不适应富文本输入了，Markdown 使用起来太舒服了。下图为 CSDN 的 Markdown 编辑器"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.52nfx6irvzk0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.52nfx6irvzk0.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"09d2d961-1b81-4234-a171-53193083c8e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a02a8039-4c11-4b57-a205-7aba1dee3311","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是我第一次写博客，陆陆续续在平台上发了几篇文章，后来我发现写文章比记笔记有效多了，当时我有一门《数字信号处理》的课程，这门课我没有采用记笔记的形式，而是写博客，将我的理解形成文章写下来，写了 20 篇，这些文章是我在该平台上阅读量以及点赞数最多的"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.rfiezobwtuo.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.rfiezobwtuo.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"18c20a13-6913-4a9f-874d-24cf1149fe76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23131cc0-1e16-4f52-8b12-28e8731cae89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我写完这些文章的时候，真的就感觉自己对这门课通透了，这门课考试的时候，我思路特别的顺畅，很快我就写完了，并提前交卷，虽然没有满分，但是我自认为这门课我学的非常的好，对这门课我有非常多自己个人的见解。从此以后我就改变了学习方法，那就是写博客。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b3cbe93b-9d0c-4c0f-9f15-9c1438afffa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而关于写作的平台我也是转战多次，最开始是 CSDN，但是 CSDN 上面广告很多，以及整体的排版不好看，后来我就在博客园上面发文章，因为博客园可以自定义样式，所以外观上可以比较好看，对于博客之外的其他内容，我通过审查元素将其设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"display: none"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，下图为我的博客园博客"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/202110022118162021-10-02-21-18-17.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/202110022118162021-10-02-21-18-17.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1a31c663-625d-44aa-8a43-aca40c3ae4ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"03aa4ef0-14b7-4d4d-a16a-78962b4f2cec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"个人博客：Hexo、Hugo 和 docsify"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fef7275-0d77-4b3b-8b00-a29a1af5d69a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来就开始捣鼓个人博客了。最初接触个人博客是通过"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yb411a7ty","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"ac711faf-58d0-48ed-a53b-abe922c1d727","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"程序羊的视频"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当时觉得有一个个人的网站好屌，正好程序羊出了这个视频，然后我就根据它的视频折腾了一个下午，搭建出来了一个基于 Hugo 网站，当时有踩一些坑，并把踩的一些坑放在该视频下面的评论里面，现在还经常能收到一些点赞。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c714390b-4bb5-48f0-99ca-5806ee95ccfa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在此基础上，我开始研究其他的博客平台，如 Hexo。Hexo 是我一直都在使用的，我主要是折腾各种主题，为博客添加上各种功能，我还记得我第一次折腾了两天时间，才折腾出一个好看的博客，当然现在是找不到了，我现在的博客已经换了三四个主题，下图为我目前的博客主题"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.snx2t2mhck0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.snx2t2mhck0.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"92a60a8e-d85d-4e1c-905d-b5ef1861a7b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"828e35a4-6d47-46ff-b627-6c9ee7069d7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后面接触了 docsify，不同于一般博客的组织方式，它的组织方式像是书籍一般，有层次结构，适合作为文档或者读书笔记，亦或者成系统组织博客内容"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.488wzni45y40.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.488wzni45y40.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"01b09356-3db9-4670-89b0-ecc048ca09b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70e9fcaa-be3c-4cf9-81d1-9ed0f89bf4cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"docsify 还有一个好处就是不用进行编译，只需要直接写好文章，然后直接发布即可，省去了编译的时间。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d7147c62-d0b5-477f-8ff8-152a7e6b447f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"个人博客：VuePress"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f148bae9-bf97-4a41-90cf-d3c2118c7614","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在后来参加阿里前端练习生计划，其中布置了一个作业，搭建一个 VuePress 博客，这是我第一次接触到 VuePress，作业的要求没有很高，只要搭建出一个网站即可，我当时就根据官方的文档搭建出一个博客，然后就没有继续了。后来因缘巧合，我本科老师希望我写一些文章分享给学弟学妹，因为我想试一下 VuePress，所以我就搭建了一个 VuePress 博客，我的博客内容如下"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.6hf89j9dlfo0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/image.6hf89j9dlfo0.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"cf1e97cb-362a-4351-ad19-4f67a231d43f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"571535da-ee13-4f82-a817-11deb644b349","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"VuePress 组织文章的方式同 docsify 有些类似，不过更加的灵活，并且可以自定义 Vue 组件，这个吸引力对我来说太大了，这意味着我可以使用 Vue 生态的东西，定义功能强大的组件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1050f2e3-78db-4145-848c-3ec11215df62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过 VuePress 对于现在的我来说有一个致命的缺点，那就是编译时间太慢，往往需要四五分钟，不过所幸，我了解到 Github Actions 提供自动部署的功能，在了解相关配置之后，也可以像 docsify 一样直接提交文档即可，Github 会根据脚本自动编译和部署。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"712646b5-5e85-4fee-91fc-0e402df3714c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过听说尤大已经推出了 VitePress，听到 Vite 那就是快的代名词，所以接下来有可能会折腾一下 VitePress，不过目前还没有迁移过去的打算，因为毕竟 VuePress 的生态在这里，VitePress 生态还没起来。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"acb8dbfc-55d9-410e-967b-26e3779260bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"云笔记：Notion"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"73bbeaed-dc50-4ac1-91c0-9ad407683609","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了写博客，还有记笔记的平台，我现在用的是 Notion，支持 Markdown，还拥有数据库等功能，提供 API 接口，教育邮箱可享 Pro Plan，云笔记，我觉得是一个非常好的平台，不过我对于 Notion 的发掘度还不够，当做一般的笔记软件绝对是够了的，下图为我的 Notion 笔记截图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/202110022120402021-10-02-21-20-41.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/202110022120402021-10-02-21-20-41.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"821eb69c-515a-4da5-9e3a-e8c2226a09ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6bb4e49a-ad05-46a3-ab09-df371da0ff92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Obsidian"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a8299d67-df17-45a4-92e0-bdad67412848","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Notion 非常的强大，但是作为一名前端工程师，Notion 提供的组件太少了，比如 Tab 切换，自定义布局，相比于博客，自定义的能力太弱，后面了解到了 Obsidian，本地，插件化，所有的笔记都保存在本地，存在强大的插件社区，而我本人也可以写插件来满足个人的需求，当时沉迷于 Obsidian 插件开发，写了四五个插件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2099dea7-bb20-4ea4-ad73-34476dd6f60e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自定义高亮块："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_5c7b36ef-e778-40e3-aca4-21bfcfe0e8c4.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_5c7b36ef-e778-40e3-aca4-21bfcfe0e8c4.png","width":589,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"db4f7ae7-9495-49cb-a420-c7b5da979aba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d93115a7-9142-4764-8111-7191c41aa3d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持 Antd 组件："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_cf60462c-cddf-46b8-b655-dd63ab20e4af.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_cf60462c-cddf-46b8-b655-dd63ab20e4af.png","width":519.5,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3101bd89-5e74-48a8-9181-06a8097f624c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_613c8366-5fc9-4dee-83fc-33634926382e.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/image_613c8366-5fc9-4dee-83fc-33634926382e.png","width":58